title: VendingMachineKid
---
<<declare $vendingmachinekid_interaction_times = 0>>

<<if $vendingmachinekid_interaction_times == 0>>
  You: Hey, how are you doing?
  John: I'm doing pretty good.
  John: I wanted a Monster before the end, but I'm pretty broke.
  You: You know, I got this Monster tower in my room I should complete. I only need one more.
  You: If you give me your empty can, I'll buy you a Monster.
  John: Really, bro? Thanks!
  <<set $vendingmachinekid_interaction_times = 1>>
<<else>>
  <<if $monster_cans == 1>>
   You: I bought you a Monster!
   John: Thanks, bro!
   John: Here's the can for your Monster tower.
   <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Pickup">>
   You got an empty monster can!
   <<set $monster_inventory_count += 1>>
  <<else>>
   John: Did you buy the Monster?
  <<endif>>
<<endif>>

===